    // ---- Q5_K (type 13) ---------------------------------------------------
    // EVERY element, not a sample. The high-bit mask sequence is 1, 4, 16, 64
    // (the C advances it with `u1 <<= 2`), so a wrong table agrees on all of
    // group 0 and disagrees from element 64 on. A test that spot-checked the
    // first six elements and one per group boundary passed against a decoder
    // with the wrong masks; this sweep does not.
